WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
BARC-RT: Quick bit of colour for you, five year swap spreads have widened about one and a half basis points this morning.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Oskar: Thanks, we noticed something similar but wanted a second source before flagging it internally.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
BARC-RT: Nothing alarming, just steady grinding wider since the open, no single catalyst we can point to.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Oskar: Any read on whether it is supply driven or more of a positioning unwind?

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
BARC-RT: Looks more like positioning, we have not seen much new issuance pricing into this move.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Oskar: That matches what we are seeing, mostly real money reducing duration ahead of month end.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
BARC-RT: Makes sense, month end rebalancing usually drags spreads a touch wider like this.

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Oskar: Appreciate the colour, nothing actionable on our side right now, just good to have the confirmation.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
BARC-RT: Understood, we will keep sending updates if the move accelerates through the day.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Oskar: Sounds good, thanks for the call.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
BARC-RT: No problem, talk later.
